[
  {
    "start": 0.1,
    "end": 3.333,
    "text": "为什么懂业务的人，能让 AI Agent 做得更多？",
    "segmentId": "c01-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c01-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 3.333,
    "end": 5.027,
    "text": "因为责任边界没有外包。",
    "segmentId": "c01-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c01-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 5.027,
    "end": 9.005,
    "text": "Anthropic 在二零二六年六月发布了一项隐私保护分析，",
    "segmentId": "c01-p02-u01",
    "sceneId": "c01-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 9.005,
    "end": 13.778,
    "text": "覆盖约四十万次 Claude Code 交互会话和约二十三万五千名用户，",
    "segmentId": "c01-p02-u01",
    "sceneId": "c01-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 13.778,
    "end": 15.89,
    "text": "观察期从二零二五年十月到二零二六年四月。",
    "segmentId": "c01-p02-u01",
    "sceneId": "c01-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 15.89,
    "end": 18.674,
    "text": "研究看到的不是专家把每个动作抓得更紧。",
    "segmentId": "c01-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c01-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 18.674,
    "end": 23.294,
    "text": "相反，领域理解越清楚，Agent 每条指令后的行动链越长，",
    "segmentId": "c01-p03-u02",
    "sceneId": "c01-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 23.294,
    "end": 25.468,
    "text": "遇到错误时也更容易被带回正确方向。",
    "segmentId": "c01-p03-u02",
    "sceneId": "c01-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 25.468,
    "end": 30.573,
    "text": "这期会把发现整理成一张责任分工卡：规划由谁定，执行交给谁，",
    "segmentId": "c01-p04-u01",
    "sceneId": "c01-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 30.573,
    "end": 32.26,
    "text": "验证看什么，失败时谁接管。",
    "segmentId": "c01-p04-u01",
    "sceneId": "c01-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 32.26,
    "end": 35.198,
    "text": "它是本期的实践推导，不是 Anthropic 官方模板。",
    "segmentId": "c01-p04-u02",
    "sceneId": "c01-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 35.198,
    "end": 39.3,
    "text": "视频全程干货高价值，让你成为更擅长使用 AI 的人，",
    "segmentId": "c01-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c01-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 39.3,
    "end": 41.147,
    "text": "内容较长，点点关注收藏不迷路。",
    "segmentId": "c01-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c01-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 41.147,
    "end": 45.488,
    "text": "第一步先看真实分工，而不是把自主程度想成一个开或关的按钮。",
    "segmentId": "c02-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 45.488,
    "end": 46.981,
    "text": "研究把决策分成两类。",
    "segmentId": "c02-p02-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 46.981,
    "end": 52.165,
    "text": "规划回答做什么、选哪条路线和怎样算完成；执行回答改哪些文件、",
    "segmentId": "c02-p02-u02",
    "sceneId": "c02-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 52.165,
    "end": 53.881,
    "text": "写什么代码和运行哪些命令。",
    "segmentId": "c02-p02-u02",
    "sceneId": "c02-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 53.881,
    "end": 57.806,
    "text": "在典型会话里，人平均做出约百分之七十的规划决策，",
    "segmentId": "c02-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 57.806,
    "end": 59.878,
    "text": "却只做出约百分之二十的执行决策。",
    "segmentId": "c02-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 59.878,
    "end": 62.746,
    "text": "换句话说，常见模式是人决定要建什么，",
    "segmentId": "c02-p04-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 62.746,
    "end": 64.441,
    "text": "Agent 决定具体怎样建。",
    "segmentId": "c02-p04-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 64.441,
    "end": 66.746,
    "text": "这并不等于人只写一句需求就离场。",
    "segmentId": "c02-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 66.746,
    "end": 70.69,
    "text": "典型会话大约有四轮往返，每轮都可以重新校正方向。",
    "segmentId": "c02-p05-u02",
    "sceneId": "c02-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 70.69,
    "end": 74.445,
    "text": "每条用户提示平均会触发大约十个 Agent 动作，",
    "segmentId": "c02-p06-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 74.445,
    "end": 76.248,
    "text": "有些会话远高于这个数字，",
    "segmentId": "c02-p06-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 76.248,
    "end": 78.564,
    "text": "所以每个检查点都可能承载很长的行动链。",
    "segmentId": "c02-p06-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 78.564,
    "end": 81.625,
    "text": "真正要写清的不是允许 Agent 做几步，",
    "segmentId": "c02-p07-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 81.625,
    "end": 83.427,
    "text": "而是哪些决定必须留给懂问题的人。",
    "segmentId": "c02-p07-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 83.427,
    "end": 84.211,
    "text": "本章小节。",
    "segmentId": "c02-p08-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p08"
  },
  {
    "start": 84.211,
    "end": 86.375,
    "text": "第一，把做什么和怎样做分开记录。",
    "segmentId": "c02-p08-u02",
    "sceneId": "c02-p08"
  },
  {
    "start": 86.375,
    "end": 89.402,
    "text": "第二，让 Agent 承担可验证的执行链，",
    "segmentId": "c02-p09-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p09"
  },
  {
    "start": 89.402,
    "end": 90.318,
    "text": "而不是替人定义目标。",
    "segmentId": "c02-p09-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p09"
  },
  {
    "start": 90.318,
    "end": 93.243,
    "text": "第三，用阶段检查点保持方向可纠正。",
    "segmentId": "c02-p10-u01",
    "sceneId": "c02-p10"
  },
  {
    "start": 93.243,
    "end": 96.128,
    "text": "第二步要理解为什么专业度会放大 Agent，",
    "segmentId": "c03-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 96.128,
    "end": 97.939,
    "text": "而不是简单压缩 Agent 的空间。",
    "segmentId": "c03-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 97.939,
    "end": 101.084,
    "text": "研究按任务把用户表现出的专业度分成五级。",
    "segmentId": "c03-p02-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 101.084,
    "end": 105.581,
    "text": "它看的是指令是否精确、要求怎样验证，以及谁在纠正谁，",
    "segmentId": "c03-p02-u02",
    "sceneId": "c03-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 105.581,
    "end": 106.774,
    "text": "不是职位或笼统能力。",
    "segmentId": "c03-p02-u02",
    "sceneId": "c03-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 106.774,
    "end": 110.977,
    "text": "同一个人换到陌生领域可能是新手；不会写代码的会计，",
    "segmentId": "c03-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 110.977,
    "end": 115.488,
    "text": "只要能说清月末对账规则并发现边界错误，也可能是该任务的专家。",
    "segmentId": "c03-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 115.488,
    "end": 116.693,
    "text": "典型新手会话中，",
    "segmentId": "c03-p04-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 116.693,
    "end": 120.229,
    "text": "每条提示大约触发五个 Agent 动作和约六百词输出。",
    "segmentId": "c03-p04-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 120.229,
    "end": 124.08,
    "text": "典型专家会话中，行动链超过两倍，约十二个动作；",
    "segmentId": "c03-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 124.08,
    "end": 126.904,
    "text": "输出约三千二百词，是新手会话的五倍左右。",
    "segmentId": "c03-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 126.904,
    "end": 131.089,
    "text": "在控制工作模式、任务价值、月份、职业和模型家族后，",
    "segmentId": "c03-p06-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 131.089,
    "end": 134.605,
    "text": "专业度每提高一级，动作数仍增加约百分之九，",
    "segmentId": "c03-p06-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 134.605,
    "end": 135.902,
    "text": "输出增加约百分之十三。",
    "segmentId": "c03-p06-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 135.902,
    "end": 137.628,
    "text": "这不是说文字越多越好，",
    "segmentId": "c03-p07-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 137.628,
    "end": 142.272,
    "text": "而是清晰约束让 Agent 能在一次交接中安全推进更多可检查工作。",
    "segmentId": "c03-p07-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 142.272,
    "end": 143.055,
    "text": "本章小节。",
    "segmentId": "c03-p08-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p08"
  },
  {
    "start": 143.055,
    "end": 145.509,
    "text": "第一，专业度是针对当前任务的理解。",
    "segmentId": "c03-p08-u02",
    "sceneId": "c03-p08"
  },
  {
    "start": 145.509,
    "end": 148.277,
    "text": "第二，明确约束会延长 Agent 的有效行动链。",
    "segmentId": "c03-p09-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p09"
  },
  {
    "start": 148.277,
    "end": 152.117,
    "text": "第三，用可验证产物衡量工作，不用输出长度代替质量。",
    "segmentId": "c03-p10-u01",
    "sceneId": "c03-p10"
  },
  {
    "start": 152.117,
    "end": 156.823,
    "text": "第三步是按能力与不确定性分工，而不是按人和机器简单切一刀。",
    "segmentId": "c04-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 156.823,
    "end": 161.059,
    "text": "稳定、可逆、规则清楚的执行可以成批交给 Agent，",
    "segmentId": "c04-p02-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 161.059,
    "end": 164.108,
    "text": "例如读取文件、机械修改、运行检查和汇总证据。",
    "segmentId": "c04-p02-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 164.108,
    "end": 168.603,
    "text": "目标定义、价值冲突、隐含约束和高代价取舍要由人负责，",
    "segmentId": "c04-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 168.603,
    "end": 171.183,
    "text": "因为这些决定依赖领域背景和后果判断。",
    "segmentId": "c04-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 171.183,
    "end": 173.245,
    "text": "当规则虽清楚但环境陌生时，",
    "segmentId": "c04-p04-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 173.245,
    "end": 177.309,
    "text": "可以让 Agent 先勘察并列出假设，人在执行前确认边界。",
    "segmentId": "c04-p04-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 177.309,
    "end": 181.629,
    "text": "当执行出现反复失败、证据互相冲突或影响范围扩大时，",
    "segmentId": "c04-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 181.629,
    "end": 184.205,
    "text": "自动化程度应该下降，责任重新回到人。",
    "segmentId": "c04-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 184.205,
    "end": 185.849,
    "text": "研究中的典型分工给出方向，",
    "segmentId": "c04-p06-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 185.849,
    "end": 188.757,
    "text": "但它来自 Claude Code 的交互会话，",
    "segmentId": "c04-p06-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 188.757,
    "end": 189.763,
    "text": "不是所有行业的固定比例。",
    "segmentId": "c04-p06-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 189.763,
    "end": 192.798,
    "text": "所以责任卡要写决定类型和升级条件，",
    "segmentId": "c04-p07-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 192.798,
    "end": 195.315,
    "text": "而不是照抄百分之七十或百分之二十。",
    "segmentId": "c04-p07-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 195.315,
    "end": 196.097,
    "text": "本章小节。",
    "segmentId": "c04-p08-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p08"
  },
  {
    "start": 196.097,
    "end": 199.091,
    "text": "第一，按可逆性和不确定性决定委派深度。",
    "segmentId": "c04-p08-u02",
    "sceneId": "c04-p08"
  },
  {
    "start": 199.091,
    "end": 202.174,
    "text": "第二，把目标、价值和高代价取舍留给人。",
    "segmentId": "c04-p09-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p09"
  },
  {
    "start": 202.174,
    "end": 205.537,
    "text": "第三，预先写明失败与冲突何时触发接管。",
    "segmentId": "c04-p10-u01",
    "sceneId": "c04-p10"
  },
  {
    "start": 205.537,
    "end": 208.511,
    "text": "第四步是把专业度转成可观察的责任动作。",
    "segmentId": "c05-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 208.511,
    "end": 212.946,
    "text": "清晰的任务定义要包含对象、约束、完成证据和明确禁区，",
    "segmentId": "c05-p02-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 212.946,
    "end": 214.282,
    "text": "不能只给一个模糊愿望。",
    "segmentId": "c05-p02-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 214.282,
    "end": 218.196,
    "text": "验证要求要在执行前写下，例如必须通过哪些测试、",
    "segmentId": "c05-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 218.196,
    "end": 220.719,
    "text": "比对哪些原始数据、保留哪些审计痕迹。",
    "segmentId": "c05-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 220.719,
    "end": 223.669,
    "text": "专业用户会在关键节点纠正 Agent，",
    "segmentId": "c05-p04-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 223.669,
    "end": 226.547,
    "text": "因为他们能识别看似顺畅却偏离业务规则的结果。",
    "segmentId": "c05-p04-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 226.547,
    "end": 230.172,
    "text": "研究的严格验证成功率从新手会话的百分之十五，",
    "segmentId": "c05-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 230.172,
    "end": 233.601,
    "text": "上升到中级及以上会话的大约百分之二十八到三十三。",
    "segmentId": "c05-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 233.601,
    "end": 236.191,
    "text": "大部分提升发生在新手到中级之间，",
    "segmentId": "c05-p06-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 236.191,
    "end": 240.353,
    "text": "说明工作性理解已经能带来很大收益，深度精通的边际增益较小。",
    "segmentId": "c05-p06-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 240.353,
    "end": 244.112,
    "text": "遇到麻烦时，专家会话转成验证成功的比例也更高；",
    "segmentId": "c05-p07-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 244.112,
    "end": 247.503,
    "text": "这提醒我们要设计恢复路径，而不是只设计顺利路径。",
    "segmentId": "c05-p07-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 247.503,
    "end": 248.278,
    "text": "本章小节。",
    "segmentId": "c05-p08-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p08"
  },
  {
    "start": 248.278,
    "end": 251.119,
    "text": "第一，把专业知识写成约束和完成证据。",
    "segmentId": "c05-p08-u02",
    "sceneId": "c05-p08"
  },
  {
    "start": 251.119,
    "end": 254.429,
    "text": "第二，在关键节点主动纠偏，不把流畅当正确。",
    "segmentId": "c05-p09-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p09"
  },
  {
    "start": 254.429,
    "end": 258.637,
    "text": "第三，为失败后的诊断、缩小范围和人工接管留出路径。",
    "segmentId": "c05-p10-u01",
    "sceneId": "c05-p10"
  },
  {
    "start": 258.637,
    "end": 261.969,
    "text": "第五步，把这些原则落到一张四栏责任分工卡。",
    "segmentId": "c06-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 261.969,
    "end": 263.439,
    "text": "第一栏是规划所有者。",
    "segmentId": "c06-p02-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 263.439,
    "end": 267.225,
    "text": "写出谁定义目标、优先级、允许的取舍和完成标准。",
    "segmentId": "c06-p02-u02",
    "sceneId": "c06-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 267.225,
    "end": 268.488,
    "text": "第二栏是执行授权。",
    "segmentId": "c06-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 268.488,
    "end": 272.756,
    "text": "列出 Agent 可以自主读取、修改、运行和组合的动作，",
    "segmentId": "c06-p03-u02",
    "sceneId": "c06-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 272.756,
    "end": 273.752,
    "text": "以及明确禁止的动作。",
    "segmentId": "c06-p03-u02",
    "sceneId": "c06-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 273.752,
    "end": 275.063,
    "text": "第三栏是验证证据。",
    "segmentId": "c06-p04-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 275.063,
    "end": 279.699,
    "text": "每个关键结果都绑定测试、原始来源、差异检查或可复现命令。",
    "segmentId": "c06-p04-u02",
    "sceneId": "c06-p04"
  },
  {
    "start": 279.699,
    "end": 281.165,
    "text": "第四栏是失败所有者。",
    "segmentId": "c06-p05-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 281.165,
    "end": 286.236,
    "text": "写清连续失败、证据冲突、范围扩大或不可逆动作出现时由谁接管。",
    "segmentId": "c06-p05-u02",
    "sceneId": "c06-p05"
  },
  {
    "start": 286.236,
    "end": 290.844,
    "text": "使用时先填规划所有者和失败所有者，再开放执行授权，",
    "segmentId": "c06-p06-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 290.844,
    "end": 292.334,
    "text": "最后逐项核对验证证据。",
    "segmentId": "c06-p06-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p06"
  },
  {
    "start": 292.334,
    "end": 296.63,
    "text": "这张卡是基于研究分工与专业度信号整理出的工作流工具，",
    "segmentId": "c06-p07-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 296.63,
    "end": 298.744,
    "text": "不代表研究已经验证了这张卡本身。",
    "segmentId": "c06-p07-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p07"
  },
  {
    "start": 298.744,
    "end": 299.527,
    "text": "本章小节。",
    "segmentId": "c06-p08-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p08"
  },
  {
    "start": 299.527,
    "end": 301.958,
    "text": "第一，先指定规划与失败责任人。",
    "segmentId": "c06-p08-u02",
    "sceneId": "c06-p08"
  },
  {
    "start": 301.958,
    "end": 304.196,
    "text": "第二，再开放有边界的执行授权。",
    "segmentId": "c06-p09-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p09"
  },
  {
    "start": 304.196,
    "end": 307.066,
    "text": "第三，用预先约定的证据决定是否完成。",
    "segmentId": "c06-p10-u01",
    "sceneId": "c06-p10"
  },
  {
    "start": 307.066,
    "end": 311.473,
    "text": "总结一下，领域专家不是因为少让 Agent 做事而更有效，",
    "segmentId": "c07-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c07-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 311.473,
    "end": 314.434,
    "text": "而是因为他们更清楚目标、约束、证据和接管时机。",
    "segmentId": "c07-p01-u01",
    "sceneId": "c07-p01"
  },
  {
    "start": 314.434,
    "end": 318.242,
    "text": "研究仍有边界：成功来自转录分类和可验证信号，",
    "segmentId": "c07-p02-u01",
    "sceneId": "c07-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 318.242,
    "end": 321.507,
    "text": "不等于真实世界结果；非交互式使用也没有纳入。",
    "segmentId": "c07-p02-u01",
    "sceneId": "c07-p02"
  },
  {
    "start": 321.507,
    "end": 325.795,
    "text": "下次启动 AI Agent 前，先写四栏：规划所有者、",
    "segmentId": "c07-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c07-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 325.795,
    "end": 327.797,
    "text": "执行授权、验证证据、失败所有者。",
    "segmentId": "c07-p03-u01",
    "sceneId": "c07-p03"
  },
  {
    "start": 327.797,
    "end": 330.667,
    "text": "关注 Tiny Agent，成为更擅长使用 AI 的人！",
    "segmentId": "c07-p04-u01",
    "sceneId": "c07-p04"
  }
]
